/	TD8E TEST PROGRAM.

/	LAST EDIT: 16-JAN-2016 CJL

/	THIS PROGRAM CARRIES OUT THE STANDARD TD8E BOOTSTRAP WITH THE EXCEPTION OF
/	NOT STARTING THE CODE UP.  IF SUCCESSFUL, THE CONTENTS OF BLOCK 0001 SHOULD
/	BE LOCATED IN X7600-X7777 WHERE X IS THE FIELD DEFINED FOR THE TEST.  X WILL
/	BE CHOSEN TO BE NON-CONFLICTING WITH MOST STANDARD OS/8 AND P?S/8 MEMORY
/	LIMITS; HOWEVER THE DATA WILL USE THE LAST TWO PAGES OF MEMORY OF FIELD X
/	[AND MORE].

/	FIELD DEFINITIONS.

	TSTFLD=	40			/THE DATA WILL WIND UP ON 47400-47777.

/	TD8E DEFINITIONS.

	SDSS=	6771			/SKIP ON SINGLE LINE FLAG SET.
	SDSQ=	6773			/SKIP ON QUAD LINE FLAG SET.
	SDLC=	6774			/LOAD COMMAND REGISTER.
	SDRC=	6776			/READ COMMAND REGISTER.
	SDRD=	6777			/READ DATA REGISTER.
	*200				/THE USUAL PLACE.

START,	CLA CLL				/CLEAN UP.
	TAD	(2000)			/GET REVERSE MOTION BIT.
	JMS	MOVE;	-22		/FIND THE END ZONE WHILE MOVING BACKWARDS.
	JMS	MOVE;	-31		/FIND THE 31 CODE WHILE MOVING FORWARDS.
	CDF	TSTFLD			/SET THE DATA FIELD FOR THE TRANSFER.
RDLUP,	SDSQ				/QUAD FLAG UP?
	JMP	RDLUP			/NO, WAIT FOR IT.
	SDRD				/YES, READ IN LATEST DATA WORD.
	DCA I	PTR			/STORE INTO THE BUFFER
	ISZ	PTR			/BUMP TO NEXT [ALSO COUNTER].
	JMP	RDLUP			/KEEP GOING.

/	AT THIS POINT ALL THE DATA SHOULD BE IN MEMORY FROM BLOCKS 0000 AND 0001.

	CDF	00			/BACK TO FIELD 0
	JMP I	(7600)			/EXIT TO OPERATING SYSTEM.

/	MOVE ROUTINE; INLINE ARGUMENT IS MARK CODE TO LOCATE.  AC=2000 FOR REVERSE.

MOVE,	.-.				/MOVE ROUTINE.
	TAD	(1000)			/ADD ON GO BIT TO PASSED DIRECTION [UNIT 0]
	SDLC				/LOAD COMMAND REGISTER.
SRCH,	SDSS				/SINGLE-LINE FLAG UP?
	JMP	SRCH			/NO, WAIT FOR IT.
	SDRC				/YES, READ IN LATEST MARK WINDOW VALUE.
	AND	(77)			/JUST MARK WINDOW BITS.
	TAD I	MOVE			/ADD ON NEGATED DESIRED VALUE.
	SZA CLA				/SKIP IF WE GOT WHAT IS WANTED.
	JMP	SRCH			/GO DO IT AGAIN IF NOT DESIRED MARK CODE.
	ISZ	MOVE			/GET PAST IN-LINE ARGUMENT.
	JMP I	MOVE			/RETURN TO CALLER.

PTR,	7354				/THIS SHOULD ALIGN THE TRANSFER AS EXPECTED.

	$				/THAT'S ALL FOLK.
